@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 <html><body>Mentor Guide:<br>
-This world is too harsh for newbies and heroes who have returned just recently. The purpose of mentoring is to help the weak in overcoming difficulties.<br>
-The one who seeks help is called the mentee, and the one who assists them - the mentor.<br>
+New heroes and those who returned to the game after a long break could have a tough time trying to make progress on their own.<br>
+That's why there is a mentoring system that lets more experienced adventurers help newbies, it makes the training much easier.<br>
+New and returned heroes are called <font color="LEVEL">mentees</font>, and those who help them - <font color="LEVEL">mentors</font>.<br>
 <Button ALIGN=LEFT ICON="RETURN" action="bypass Script MentorGuide 33587-01.htm">Back</Button>
-</body></html>
