@@ -1,11 +1,11 @@
 <html><body>Mentor Guide:<br>
 <font color="LEVEL">1. The mentor buff is called Mentee's Appreciation</font>.<br1>
-It grants acquired XP/ SP +5% to the mentor. Applied only when mentee is logged in.<br>
+Mentee's Appreciation is a buff for mentors. It's effect is acquired XP/ SP +5%/ The buff is active only when the mentee is online.<br>
 <font color="LEVEL">2. The mentee buff</font>.<br1>
-A mentee taught by a mentor gets 4 buffs of Melody, 3 buffs of Sonatas and 1 buff of Harmony. The buffs are activated when the mentor is logged in and remain 5 min. after his/ her log out.<br>
-<font color="LEVEL">3. The buff that summons mentor and enhances mentee's stats</font>.<br1>
-Being a mentor you can teach your mentee useful skills.<br>
-However, it's very difficult to teach somebody if you are too far away. And so the mentee is granted a skill that allows them to teleport their mentor to themselves.<br>
-Mentee's Mentor Summon and Mentor's Art of Seduction can be found in the skill window, in the Clan/ Hero/ Mentorship Skills section.<br>
+Mentees can acquire the following effects: <font color="LEVEL">Musician's Melody - Mentor, Sonata Performance - Mentor, Mentor's Harmony</font>. These effects are active while the mentor is online and disappear in 5 min. if the mentor goes offline.<br>
+<font color="LEVEL">3. Mentee ability boost and Mentee's Mentor Summon</font><br1>
+Mentors can give a powerful <font color="LEVEL">Mentor's Art of Seduction</font> buff to their mentees using the skill of the same skill.<br>
+The mentor can use the skill only if the mentee is near him or her. Mentees have a special <font color="LEVEL">Mentee's Mentor Summon</font> skill to move to their mentors quickly.<br>
+You can find it in the Skills window, <font color="LEVEL">Clan/ Hero/ Mentor Skills</font> section.<br>
 <Button ALIGN=LEFT ICON="RETURN" action="bypass Script MentorGuide 33587-01.htm">Back</Button>
-</body></html>
